DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbffee driver provides support for Broadcom BCM4401 based Fast Ethernet
     adapters.

     The bbffee driver supports the following media types:

     aauuttoosseelleecctt   Enable autoselection of the media type and options.

     1100bbaasseeTT//UUTTPP  Set 10Mbps operation.

     110000bbaasseeTTXX    Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet) operation.

     The bbffee driver supports the following media options:

     ffuullll--dduupplleexx  Set full duplex operation.

     For further information on configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

